From f7621f6e71c655e887fb77388765eabab1b365ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 02:00:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 185/186] GB-Link: native USB module, real GBA as controller,
 cartridge save dump

InputCommon/GBLink: libusb transport for the GB-Link adapter, multiboot of the OrreLink
GBA agent (or stock Cart Doctor dumper), read-only cartridge save dump, and a Manager
thread that publishes the real GBA's key state. GBAPad merges those keys so the
connected GBA counts as the player's controller automatically.
